Subject: [PATCH] Reproducible runs: seeds, per-image JSON record,
 object-preserving prompt, restricted conditions

- seeded sampling, classification (temperature 0 + seed) and variation
- per-image JSON sidecar with conditions, seeds, prompt, model, response id, SHA-256
- prompt forbids moving/resizing/redrawing objects and changing framing
- conditions-citra.yaml (Brazilian coast) and optional conditions-citra-risk.yaml
- get_variation no longer fails on classes the classifier omitted
- tests for seed derivation and variation

