+  afternoon: Afternoon daylight with warm angled illumination.
+
+sky:
+  overcast: Fully overcast sky with uniform grey cloud cover.
+
+atmosphere:
+  heavy_rain: Heavy tropical rainfall with significant visibility reduction.
+  dense_fog: Dense fog or sea mist with strongly reduced visibility.
